### Health check — no auth required
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### OpenAPI spec — no auth required
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/openapi.json

### Auth chain debug — requires a Clerk session cookie (dev only, 404s in production)
# Get the cookie value: sign in at {{baseUrl}}/sign-in in your browser, open DevTools →
# Application → Cookies, copy the `__session` cookie, and paste it into
# requests/http-client.private.env.json under "clerkSessionCookie" (gitignored, never commit it).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/debug/auth-check
Cookie: {{clerkSessionCookie}}

### Auth chain debug — signed out (expect verdict: "no-clerk-session")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/debug/auth-check
